  },
  "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/DefectsFaults": {
    "mds:value": "failures",
    "mds:quote": "the long-term reliability and efficiency of photovoltaic (PV) systems remain a concern due to environmental exposure and operational stresses that lead to structural and electrical failures over time"
  },
  "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/ImageAnalysis": {
    "mds:value": "analysis using a biorthogonal filter, followed by a continuous anisotropic Cauchy wavelet, on EL images of polycrystalline and monocrystalline silicon photovoltaic (PV) cells under varying current levels",
    "mds:quote": "The wavelet-based approach facilitates the identification of electrode-cell interfaces defects that are not readily visible in EL imaging alone."
  },
  "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/ElectroluminescencePl": {
    "mds:value": "electroluminescence images",
    "mds:quote": "EL imaging allows for the detection of both visible and invisible structural defects such as microcracks and soldering issues, which are critical to maintaining cell efficiency"
  },
  "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/PhotovoltaicModules": {
    "mds:value": "PV modules",
    "mds:quote": "Countries, have invested in PV technology development (Pezzutto et al., 2021 ). In line with Gorjian et al., the policies outlined in the 6th development plan had a negative impact on Iran's solar PV deployment (Gorjian et al., 2019)."
  },
  "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/SiliconMaterials": {
    "mds:value": "polycrystalline and monocrystalline silicon",
    "mds:quote": "Our findings reveal that cells with poor soldering at electrode interfaces exhibit up to a 16.3% reduction in maximum normalized power (MNP)"
  },
  "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/EvaluationAnalysisMethods": {
    "mds:value": "two-dimensional discrete wavelet transform analysis and continuous anisotropic Cauchy wavelet, on EL images",
    "mds:quote": "By applying two-dimensional discrete and continuous wavelet transforms (2D-DWT and 2D-CWT) to EL images, this study provides a more detailed assessment of PV cell integrity,"
  },
  "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/WaveletTransformationTechniques": {
    "mds:value": "Two-dimensional discrete wavelet transform analysis using a biorthogonal filter, followed by a continuous anisotropic Cauchy wavelet",
    "mds:quote": "The wavelet-based approach facilitates the identification of electrode-cell interfaces defects that are not readily visible in EL imaging alone."
  },
  "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/SignalProcessingFiltering": {
    "mds:value": "discrete and continuous analysis employing an anisotropicCauchy wavelet",
    "mds:quote": "Our findings reveal that cells with poor soldering at electrode interfaces exhibit up to a 16.3% reduction in maximum normalized power (MNP)"
  },
  "https://cwrusdle.bitbucket.io/mds/generic/FaultDetectionLocation": {
    "mds:value": "electrical contact failures at the electrode-cell interface",
